  "assessment": "Certification uses five elements: Module quizzes 15%, Practical 15%, Case reviews 20%, Planning pack 20%, Capstone 30%. Readiness requires 75% overall, at least 70% on every element, and the capstone presentation pass defined in the course guide.",
